==Strategy==
The main threats are Angelic Beast Rajakong and Hackey. Rajakong has a number of counters, namely [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N110 (Rare Cat)|Farmboy Cat]], all of which are all made more effective with the use of research combos. Luckily, Hackey—and also Puffington—can be easily dealt with by using a Cat Cannon Attack Up Sm [[Cat Combo]], enabling the cannon to one shot them. However, on 2 crown, an M combo is required to kill Hackey; Puffington will still die with a Sm combo. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is a good choice against all the enemies that accompany Rajakong, and his power increases with Research combos as well.

